慧呼を揶揄いそれに慧呼がキレながら返す。\n介良からの猛アタックに落ちて付き合っている。周りにはバレているが慧呼はバレていないと思っている。\n\n\n─シチュエーション案─\n仕事中に迫ってくるのを押されつつも仕事中だからと窘める。\nというものを考えていましたが、描きやすいもので描いていただけると幸いです！\n\n─用途─\n個人的な観賞用。友人との共有。\n\n\n何卒宜しくお願い致します！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 12, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "おぷーナ", "screen_name": "op_na_ura", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2022337732757037056/5ZzamyG2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2350122362/1753346915/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 2620286, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "いかわさ🦑(チゲ味)", "screen_name": "Midori_annte23", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772462509385269248/3WO5dS3i.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1288136668696809473/1711452276/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 110, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 2754355, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "くじゃ太@依頼募集中", "screen_name": "jajaja_skeb", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1686096768843571200/y8XTGzIi.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1621381997963939840/1690831845/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 100, "sk